flowchart TD
    classDef component fill:#f9f9f9,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef storage fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#0288d1,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef external fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#8e24aa,stroke-width:2px;

    Client[Client Applications] -->|Text Requests| API[Embedding API / Router]

    subgraph EmbeddingService [Embedding Service Architecture]
        API --> Cache[(Quantized In-Memory Cache)]

        Cache -->|Cache Miss| BatchQueue[Dynamic Micro-Batching Queue]
        Cache -->|Cache Hit| ResDist[Response Distribution]

        BatchQueue -->|Batched Contexts| AdapterPool

        subgraph AdapterPool [Multi-Model Adapter Pool]
            AdapterA[Local Model Adapter]
            AdapterB[OpenAI Adapter]
            AdapterC[Custom Model Adapter]
        end

        AdapterPool -->|Raw Embeddings| DimLayer[Dimensionality Projection Layer]

        DimLayer -->|Projected & Normalized| Cache
        DimLayer -->|Final Embeddings| ResDist
    end

    ResDist -->|Results| Client

    AdapterA -.-> ModelLocal[Local ML Model]
    AdapterB -.-> ModelRemote[Remote LLM API]

    class Cache storage;
    class API,BatchQueue,ResDist,DimLayer,AdapterA,AdapterB,AdapterC component;
    class Client,ModelLocal,ModelRemote external;
